@startuml
title 图 RA-04　时序图·段落问答与引用校验（UC06、UC08 的对象交互）
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei

actor "Reader\n阅读者" as P1
boundary "ReaderUI\n阅读工作台" as P2
control "QAController\n问答控制器" as P3
control "PolicyGate\n权限与证据门控" as P4
control "EvidenceAssembler\n证据组装" as P5
boundary "ConsentDialog\n外发确认" as P6
participant "ModelAdapter\n模型适配器" as P7
control "CitationVerifier\n引用校验" as P8
entity "AuditEvent\n审计事件" as P9
entity "Query\n查询" as P10
entity "Evidence\n证据" as P11
entity "Answer\n回答" as P12
entity "Citation\n引用" as P13

P1 -> P2 : 选中段落并提交问题
P2 -> P3 : ask(selection, question)
P3 -> P10 : create(text, scope)
P3 -> P4 : check(query)
P4 -> P5 : 请求授权范围内候选证据
P5 -> P11 : build(blocks)
P11 --> P5 : Evidence Contract（完整/不足）
alt [证据覆盖不足]
  P4 --> P3 : needs_human_review
  P3 --> P2 : 提示补充范围或读原文
end
P4 --> P3 : 门控通过 + 拟外发清单
P3 -> P6 : requestConsent(files, service, purpose)
P6 --> P1 : 逐文件展示范围、服务与用途
P1 --> P6 : 本次确认 / 拒绝
alt [拒绝或策略禁止云端]
  P6 --> P3 : rejected
  P3 --> P2 : local_evidence_only（本地证据/原文）
end
P6 -> P9 : record(decision, policy_version)
P3 -> P7 : generate(evidenceContract)
P7 --> P3 : AnswerSchema(claims, citations)
P3 -> P12 : create(status)
P3 -> P8 : verify(claims, allowList)
P8 -> P13 : resolve(evidence_id, quote, page)
alt [引用越界 / quote 不匹配 / 定位失败]
  P8 --> P3 : citation_invalid（标记失效）
end
P8 --> P3 : citation_checked（逐条 support_status）
P3 -> P12 : markAnswered()
P3 --> P2 : 带引用回答 + 跳转核验入口
opt [模型超时或失败]
  P3 --> P2 : model_failed + 原文/检索结果
end
opt [无依据]
  P3 --> P2 : refused（无法确认）
end
@enduml
